Version 2.0.

Modifications and enhancements by fatidaprilian (https://github.com/fatidaprilian/evtraw):
- Real-time SCHED_FIFO 98 scheduling priority for system_server InputReader and InputDispatcher threads.
- Dynamic game-scoped PM QoS CPU DMA latency bounding (50us) to eliminate deep C-state sleep jitter during active gaming.
- Direct hardware touch controller sysfs polling rate maximization and palm deadzone reduction.
- LSPosed companion engine delivering unbuffered touch dispatch and 1px touch slop sensitivity strictly to target games.
- In-process render thread prioritization (-10) for game render and UI loops.
- Streamlined Magisk, KernelSU, and APatch root installation workflow.
